OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,6,Frain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,7,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,8,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavier later on.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,13,Fchangeable period with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain. Staying quite
OL,15,Fcool for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
